---
source: crates/beforerunit-core/tests/progression.rs
expression: "progression(\"find . -name \\\"*.bak\\\" | xargs rm\")"
---
f                                        | IDLE     Typing command...
find                                     | KNOWN    Searches for files.
find .                                   | KNOWN    Searches for files in ".".
find . -name "*.bak" | xargs             | CAUTION  Runs a command on every piped item.
find . -name "*.bak" | xargs r           | KNOWN    Searches for files in ".".
find . -name "*.bak" | xargs rm          | CAUTION  Deletes the piped items. Skips Trash.
